## Interface: 16001
## Title: HarvestMate Enhanced
## Notes: All-in-one gathering for WoW Forever: where to level Herbalism, Mining, Skinning and Fishing, farms ranked for skill or gold, routes on the map, hunting circuits, one-key gathering and session stats.
## Author: HarvestMate Enhanced contributors (with HarvestMate by AndreiBerkut, Gatherpedia by Curs3d221, GatherPath Forever by severd8)
## Version: 0.7.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\HarvestMateEnhanced\Media\Logo
## AllowLoadGameType: forever
## OptionalDeps: GatherMate2, Questie, ForeverGPS, Auctionator, TradeSkillMaster, TomTom, HarvestMate, Gatherpedia, GatherPathForever
## SavedVariables: HarvestMateEnhancedDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: HarvestMateEnhancedCharDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: HarvestMateEnhanced_OnCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: HarvestMateEnhanced_OnCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: HarvestMateEnhanced_OnCompartmentLeave
## Category: Professions
## X-License: GPL-3.0 (combined work; HME's own code GPL-3.0-or-later)
## X-Website: https://github.com/Stoffe101/HarvestMate-Enhanced

